 Exercise-1:Write a JavaScript program to link JavaScript file with the HTML page
We have two ways to link java script with html 1. Internal 2. External
1.internal: using script tag.
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8">
 <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-
scale=1.0">
 <title>Document</title>
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="day2.css">
</head>
<body>
 <p>this is example for linking js with html using script tag 
anywhere inside body and outside body</p>
 
</body>
<script>
alert(“hello welcome to js")
</script>
</html>
Note: it is suggested write script tag after closing body tag 
